<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><ref refid="group__types_1ga4bdf4bfe76b9ffa6fa64c47d8bfa0c78" kindref="member" tooltip="real number">Real</ref><sp/>probability(<ref refid="group__types_1gaf38bdb4c54463b1f456655efa95b5c77" kindref="member" tooltip="size of a container">Size</ref><sp/>i,<sp/><ref refid="group__types_1gaf38bdb4c54463b1f456655efa95b5c77" kindref="member" tooltip="size of a container">Size</ref><sp/>index,<sp/><ref refid="group__types_1gaf38bdb4c54463b1f456655efa95b5c77" kindref="member" tooltip="size of a container">Size</ref><sp/>branch)<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">const</highlight><highlight class="normal">;</highlight></codeline>
